-- title:
--   The top round (`top_le`)
-- statement:
--   The top round.
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.KFV57CostR`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem NLogN.KFV.top_le (hK : 0 < K) (hℓ : 1 ≤ ℓ) {W B : ℕ} (hDW : D ≤ W)
--       (hS : 10 ^ 12 * (B + 2) ^ 3 ≤ 2 ^ ℓ) :
--       cTopC D ℓ K long ((Ex.lit 0 : Ex HS).size + (Ex.reg gNL : Ex HS).size +
--         (Ex.add (.reg gNn) (.neg (.reg gNL)) : Ex HS).size) W B ≤
--         2 * 10 ^ 11 * (D + 1) * (W + 1) * (2 ^ nB D ℓ K long * 2 ^ ℓ)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** KFV §57: cost of the rounds of the uniform Lemma 16 procedures
--
--   With `X = 2^n · 2^ℓ` (`n = |tgtL|`) the number of coefficients and `S` a bound for the small
--   quantities (`B + 2`, `zsz U + 2`, `D ℓ + 1`, …) with `10^12 S^3 ≤ 2^ℓ`:
--
--   * `leafR_le`: a prefix leaf costs `≤ 10^11 (D+1)(W+1) X`;
--   * `top_le`: the top round costs `≤ 10^12 (D+1)(W+1) X`;
--   * `twist_le`: a twist costs `≤ 10^10 (W+1) X`;
--   * **`cFwd_le`**, **`cOpp_le`**: the forward / opposite procedure costs
--     `≤ 10^13 (W+1) X (K (D+1) + ℓ) + ℓ · cCh`.
